      "notes": "Published preferred case 1; no coefficients are replaced by an independent fit. Parameter errors retain printed estimated standard deviations; covariance and confidence level are unavailable. Source molar and cell V0 uncertainties disagree after unit conversion (especially RbCl); canonical values/errors are converted from the molar row actually used by EoSFit7; both printed forms are retained. Rounded coefficients do not reproduce every benchmark at the last printed ratio digit. Full covariance, original EoSFit7 inputs, and raw GSAS projects were not exposed by the retrieved public deposit. Supplement footnotes cite Decker 1973 and Matsui 2007 whereas main references cite Decker 1971 and Matsui 2009. Historical CsCl Vinet-MGD coefficients and GUI defaults are recovered; the saved runtime settings and five pressure discrepancies remain unresolved.",
