          "notes": "Independent family follow-up replays recovered historical CsCl module/GUI defaults; no shared calibrant record is bundled. All 109 gauge pressures agree within reported errors plus rounding, with five beyond pressure/volume rounding. Saved runtime a0, raw ruby wavelengths and full source covariance remain unavailable. Public code propagates diagonal V,T input errors into PVT covariance; that is not evidence of full fitting-workflow recovery."
